window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>From <i>USA Today</i> best-selling author L. R. W. Lee, <i>Destroyed</i> is the fourth and final book in the addictive Morningstar Academy series, about a fallen angel who fights to save a world spiraling out of control, all while trying to protect humans and her own heart. This intriguing and unseen world of angels and demons is perfect for fans of <i>Good Omens</i> and <i>Penryn &amp; the End of Days</i>.</p> <p>Armageddon is coming and it’s one minute to midnight.</p> <p>Time is ticking, not just for the world, but for Gladriel. She disobeyed an explicit order of the Almighty and now the final reckoning has arrived and she must face her own inner turmoil—how much remorse must she have to be forgiven by the Almighty and welcomed back into his embrace?</p> <p>Kessien can’t let Gladriel go. He’s torn between duty and love, but even as she walked away from him... into Dante’s arms, he swears to move Heaven and Earth to bring her back—even if she doesn’t love him in return.</p> <p>As the war between Heaven and Hell heats to scorching, will Kessien succeed in rescuing Glad from destruction or will she spend eternity in the flames of Hell, or worse, back at Morningstar Academy?</p>"; 
